msgid ""
"The Starter eStore is perfect for small shops with a limited product range. "
"The Premium eStore is designed for businesses that need more flexibility and "
"control. If you plan to grow your catalog or sell more actively, Premium is "
"the better choice. You can always start small and upgrade later without "
"losing your content."
msgstr ""
"De Starter eStore is perfect voor kleine shops met een beperkt assortiment. "
"De Premium eStore is ontworpen voor bedrijven die meer flexibiliteit en "
"controle nodig hebben. Als u uw catalogus wilt uitbreiden of actiever wilt "
"verkopen, is Premium de betere keuze. U kunt altijd klein beginnen en later "
"upgraden zonder uw content te verliezen."

