#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:203
msgid "Customers can place orders directly through your website."
msgstr "Klanten kunnen direct via uw website bestellingen plaatsen."

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:204
msgid "The flow is designed to feel familiar and trustworthy."
msgstr "De flow is ontworpen om vertrouwd en betrouwbaar aan te voelen."

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:207
msgid "You can focus on selling instead of managing technical details."
msgstr ""
"U kunt zich richten op verkopen in plaats van technische details beheren."

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:217
msgid "Designed for small shops"
msgstr "Ontworpen voor kleine shops"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:220
msgid "This plan is intentionally kept simple."
msgstr "Dit plan is bewust eenvoudig gehouden."

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:223
msgid "Best suited for small product ranges and starter shops"
msgstr "Het meest geschikt voor kleine assortimenten en startende shops"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:224
msgid ""
"Advanced features like large catalogs or complex inventory are not included"
msgstr ""
"Geavanceerde functies zoals grote catalogi of complexe voorraad zijn niet "
"inbegrepen"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:225
msgid "You can upgrade later if your shop grows"
msgstr "U kunt later upgraden als uw shop groeit"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:228
msgid ""
"You are not locked into this plan. As your business grows, you can move to a "
"more advanced eStore. Your products and content stay in place. Upgrading "
"does not require rebuilding your site."
msgstr ""
"U zit niet vast aan dit plan. Naarmate uw bedrijf groeit, kunt u overstappen "
"naar een geavanceerdere eStore. Uw producten en content blijven staan. "
"Upgraden vereist geen herbouw van uw website."

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:238
msgid "Ready to start selling online?"
msgstr "Klaar om online te verkopen?"

#: .\templates\pages\websites\starter_estore_plan.html:241
